  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 22753544720384
    m_Localized: Common
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22753544720385
    m_Localized: Rare
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 881679618048
    m_Localized: Aniki Magazine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 950298431488
    m_Localized: "When the wearer is attacked, they have a 5% chance to increase
      their magic defense by 5\u201310% (+5% per copy) until the end of combat, depending
      on their missing Health."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22753548914688
    m_Localized: Italian Completo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22753548914689
    m_Localized: The wearer increases their Health by 15 (+5 per copy) for every
      10 strength.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22753548914690
    m_Localized: Birthday Hat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22753548914691
    m_Localized: When the wearer attacks, they steal 10% (+5% per copy) of the target's
      magic power for the rest of combat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22753548914692
    m_Localized: Porcelain Doll
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22753548914693
    m_Localized: The wearer increases their strength by 25% (+10% per copy), but
      reduces their physical and magic defense by 15% (+10% per copy).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22753548914694
    m_Localized: Moonstone Necklace
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22753548914695
    m_Localized: Once per combat, when the wearer's Health falls below 30%, they
      recover 20% (+10% per copy) of their Health and consume 50% (+10% per copy)
      of their current Energy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22753548914696
    m_Localized: Pressure Cooker
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22753548914697
    m_Localized: The wearer increases their physical defense by 30%. When attacked,
      they have a 10% chance to become stunned and lose their next turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22753548914698
    m_Localized: Bag of Fish
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22753548914699
    m_Localized: When the wearer hits with a basic attack or a skill, they have a
      10% chance to reduce the target's speed by 5% (+1.5% per copy).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22753553108992
    m_Localized: Out-of-Circulation Bill
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22753553108993
    m_Localized: The wearer reduces the Energy cost of their skills by 10% (+3% per
      copy). Additionally, the wearer increases the chance that enemies attack them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22753553108994
    m_Localized: 3-Pronged PVC
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22753553108995
    m_Localized: 'The wearer replaces their basic attack with a multi-attack: it
      hits the target and a random combatant adjacent to the target. The attack''s
      damage is reduced to 66% (+10% per copy).'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22753553108996
    m_Localized: Salt Beer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22753553108997
    m_Localized: When the wearer uses a skill with an enemy target, there is a 20%
      (+20% per copy) chance that it hits all enemies and also one random unit adjacent
      to the wearer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22753553108998
    m_Localized: Squash Knife
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22753553108999
    m_Localized: When the wearer hits with a basic attack or a skill, they reduce
      the target's physical defense by 10% per hit and apply 1 bleed stack. Each
      stack (20 max.) deals 10 damage per turn and reduces the target's speed by
      5% until the end of combat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22753553109000
    m_Localized: CD Player
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22753553109001
    m_Localized: When the wearer attacks or uses a skill, they have a 10% (+5% per
      copy) chance to repeat their turn immediately.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
